 "text": "Specialists in voltage control and regulation\n\nMore than 60 years designing and manufacturing toroidal transformers, drives and voltage stabilizers for general industry.\nWe also manufacture load benches and resistors for factories and industrial buildings.\n\n More Information \n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDo you need a custom design or fabrication?\n\nWe manufacture all types of components for voltage regulation and control.\nEvery industry has unique needs in the regulation and transformation of electrical voltage. Having custom-designed solutions makes a difference in the performance, efficiency and safety of your installations. Our team is ready to advise you every step of the way, from selecting the right equipment to integrating it into your electrical systems. If you need information about our products, want a customized solution or have any technical questions, we are here to help you. \n\n More Information \n\nToroidal transformers and all types of voltage regulation products\n\nWe are Manufacturers\n\nWe manufacture customized equipment for voltage regulation, offering advanced solutions for the industry.\nOur goal is to maintain the reliability of our customers for our products and processes, the excellent quality-price ratio that characterizes us, and to become the first choice of our customers.\nOur capacity for innovation positions us as a strategic ally in the optimization of industrial electrical systems. Rely on solutions designed to maximize efficiency and safety. \n\n More Information \n\nOur Services\n\n60 years of experience\n\nVariable voltage drives\n\nToroidal shocks\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nControl buttons and terminals\n\nPotentiometers and rheostats\n\nPortaleds\n\nResistors\n\nCoil for\nelectromagnets\n\nCores\ntoroidal\n\nOur Products\n\nDownload our complete catalog\n\n Find all the technical specifications of our toroidal transformers, stabilizers, coils and electrical components.\nOur catalog includes detailed data sheets for each product, power data, materials, tolerances and custom manufacturing options. \n\nDownload Catalog \n\nWe are present in more than 30 countries\n\nWe manufacture customized equipment.\n\nPrecision and efficiency are key in every development, so we integrate 3D modeling technology and real-time simulations to optimize each phase of the process. This allows us to guarantee an exact fit to the needs of each application, ensuring reliable performance and longer equipment life. \n\nCONTACT WITH US\n\nDo you need technical advice or a quotation?\n Write us and we will solve it for you\n\nIn Torivac you will find a wide range of specialized products for voltage regulation, designed to offer maximum performance in industrial applications and high demanding electrical systems. We have multiple sizes and formats, as well as custom manufacturing options that guarantee a solution adapted to every need. Our team of experts is ready to advise you on the best choice for your project. \n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName \n*\nCorreo \n*\n\nName Mensaje Correo\n\nMensaje\n\n*\nI have read and accept the Legal Notice\nSend\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and Google’s Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.",
